From 4ed1a29bb10eac31a826b593f9807e07e8766963 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ksg <sisungaa851@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:31:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add body framing guide to the pose camera preview

Draw a dashed front, side or floor silhouette with corner marks over the
live camera preview so users can see where the body must stand to be
detected. During analysis the guide turns green when required joints fit,
amber with a red cut edge when a joint leaves the frame, and shows a short
repositioning hint. The guide is preview-only; recorded clips stay the
original camera stream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
